            "review_title": "Review at Alpine Restaurant",
            "review_text": "moro2010\nIquique, Chile79 contributions\n0\nAlpine Restaurant, bad, a disappointment.\nJun 2024 • Couples\nWe came to this restaurant based on a recommendation, upon reviewing the reviews on the internet we thought it was good. However, I didn't like it at all. First, to bring my dish (spaghetti carbonara), it took almost an hour to arrive. The other dishes that were ordered did not arrive. After having been served my dish, I asked about the others and they told me there were 10 more minutes left. As a comment, I must say that the spaghetti carbonara was overcooked. Furthermore, after our arrival at the restaurant, two other groups arrived and their food arrived before the only thing that arrived at my table. Finally, I said I no longer wanted the other dishes and paid for what I had consumed. Oh, I forgot, they allow smoking inside.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten June 2, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
